%% Sim-Engine dataflow sequence diagram
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as Sim-Engine-Frontend
    participant BE as Sim-Engine-Backend
    participant CE as Calculation Engine
    participant ODB as Operational DB
    participant SDB as Snapshot DB
    participant KQ as Kafkaesque Queue
    participant P2DB as Phase-2 Target DB

    FE->>BE: HTTPS/REST\nSubmit system-id
    BE->>CE: gRPC/mTLS\nForward system-id
    CE->>ODB: JDBC/SQL\nFetch 1,000,000 rows × 50 columns
    ODB-->>CE: SQL Resultset\n(Chunked streaming)
    CE->>SDB: Batch ETL\nPersist snapshot dataset
    CE-->>BE: Event/Webhook\nSnapshotReady(system-id)
    Note over FE,BE: Phase 1 (current year)

    BE->>SDB: JDBC/Read Replica\nRead persisted snapshot
    BE->>KQ: Kafka (Avro/Proto)\nPublish snapshot pointer
    KQ-->>P2DB: Kafka Connect/Sink\nPersist into separate DB
    Note over KQ,P2DB: Phase 2 (deferred)

